Lucky Lode — attribution and licensing
======================================

Lucky Lode is a fair-launch, hybrid PoW/PoS mineable coin. This repository
contains the Rust reference crates and the design documents; the node/wallet
software is a fork of VerusCoin maintained in the `verus/` submodule/fork
(see `verus/NOTICE`).

